  m_text: '5. Detecting Fake Audio


    AI-generated voices can sound realistic
    but may still contain subtle problems.


    Possible signs:

    Monotone delivery

    Unnatural
    pauses

    Inconsistent emotion

    Robotic background noise

    Unusual word
    choices

'
