  m_text: '5. Think Before Trusting or Sharing


    Not all misinformation is completely
    fake.


    Some stories use real events, real images, or real people while changing
    important details to manipulate the reader.


    Critical thinking and source
    verification are the best ways to identify misinformation online.'
